{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"MAT","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"马太福音","commonName":"马太福音","title":"马太福音","order":40,"numberOfChapters":28,"sha256":"c4984865a36f81138c82e61e1ff8ed1131c1d78b1c80e0f356cd59b636f5dd42","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MAT/1.json","lastChapterNumber":28,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MAT/28.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1069},"chapter":{"number":28,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶稣复活"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["安息日将尽，七日的头一日，天快亮的时候，抹大拉的马利亚和那个马利亚来看坟墓。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["忽然，地大震动；因为有主的使者从天上下来，把石头滚开，坐在上面。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["他的相貌如同闪电，衣服洁白如雪。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["看守的人就因他吓得浑身乱战，甚至和死人一样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["天使对妇女说：「不要害怕！我知道你们是寻找那钉十字架的耶稣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["他不在这里，照他所说的，已经复活了。你们来看安放主的地方。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["快去告诉他的门徒，说他从死里复活了，并且在你们以先往加利利去，在那里你们要见他。看哪，我已经告诉你们了。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["妇女们就急忙离开坟墓，又害怕，又大大地欢喜，跑去要报给他的门徒。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["忽然，耶稣遇见她们，说：「愿你们平安！」她们就上前抱住他的脚拜他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["耶稣对她们说：「不要害怕！你们去告诉我的弟兄，叫他们往加利利去，在那里必见我。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["看守的兵报告祭司长"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["她们去的时候，看守的兵有几个进城去，将所经历的事都报给祭司长。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["祭司长和长老聚集商议，就拿许多银钱给兵丁，说："]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["「你们要这样说：『夜间我们睡觉的时候，他的门徒来，把他偷去了。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["倘若这话被巡抚听见，有我们劝他，保你们无事。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["兵丁受了银钱，就照所嘱咐他们的去行。这话就传说在犹太人中间，直到今日。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["门徒奉差遣"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["十一个门徒往加利利去，到了耶稣约定的山上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["他们见了耶稣就拜他，然而还有人疑惑。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["耶稣进前来，对他们说：「天上地下所有的权柄都赐给我了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["所以，你们要去，使万民作我的门徒，奉父、子、圣灵的名给他们施洗",{"noteId":37},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["凡我所吩咐你们的，都教训他们遵守，我就常与你们同在，直到世界的末了。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":37,"caller":"-","text":"或译：给他们施洗，归于父、子、圣灵的名","reference":{"chapter":28,"verse":19}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MAT/28.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MRK/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MAT/27.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":20}